SH 登录服务器，手动运行一个 Python 程序（如 python）\n2. 使用 VSCode，通过 Remote-SSH 插件再次连接这台安装22.1版本插件的服务器\n3. 连接后发现所有正在运行的 Python 进程都被 kill 掉，而 vim、tmux、C 语言等其它进程没有受到影响\n\n期望结果\n期望 VSCode 连接时不会主动 kill 用户正在运行的 Python 进程，尤其是其它类型的进程（如 vim、tmux、C 程序）并不会受到影响，疑似插件存在相关问题或 bug。\n\n补充说明\n该现象仅在插件 22.1 版本下出现。\n之前的插件版本没有此问题（如果有此信息可补充）。\n只 kill 掉 Python 进程，其它程序不受影响。","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/107/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/107/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/comments/2816956880","html_url":"https://github.com/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/107#issuecomment-2816956880","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/107","id":2816956880,"node_id":"IC_kwDOMRdAoc6n51nQ","user":{"login":"Deg2v","id":49941008,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTQxMDA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49941008?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deg2v","html_url":"https://github.com/Deg2v","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deg2v/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deg2v/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deg2v/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deg2v/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deg2v/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deg2v/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deg2v/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deg2v/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Deg2v/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-20T02:34:00Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T02:34:00Z","body":"2.22.3也还是会","auth